# Normalise to LF in the repository regardless of the checkout platform.
#
# This project is developed on Windows but the source is plain ASCII/UTF-8 with
# no platform-sensitive line endings, and several modules deliberately contain
# control characters written as \uXXXX escapes (see the README gotcha about
# boundaryKey and OutlineBuilder). Letting core.autocrlf rewrite line endings
# per-platform would make every file show as wholly modified on a fresh clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated, and large. Not worth diffing.
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated
